              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, shield and thrusting spear. May have light armour (+2 pts) and become Open Order. Skirmishers, Parthian Shot, Feigned Flight. Late Venetian armies only; 0-2 units (1+ in Venetian Greek). (Armies of Chivalry p.36)</characteristic>
