              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Multi-barrelled artillery (ribauld/organ-gun): fires with a template at Strength 4, can stand &amp; shoot when charged. 0-1 light or multi-barrelled gun per 750 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). (Armies of Chivalry p.37)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
